{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38727","headline":"别衡州牧 · 杜荀鹤","name":"别衡州牧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝别使君门，暮投江上村。\n从来无旧分，临去望何恩。\n行计自不定，此心谁与论。\n秋猿叫寒月，祗欲断人魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}